      <title>AI Doom: Prepare for Risk, Prioritize Safety, Don't Panic</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-08/ai-doom-prepare-for-risk-prioritize-safety-don-t-panic</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">ff213a09ee52c2946d030e87</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 10:00:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>“Nobody knows anything,” the screenwriter William Goldman famously said of the movie business. Much the same can be said today for artificial intelligence, a technology that’s moving fast, destination unknown. Unlike movies, though, the bots may one day rise up and exterminate humanity, according to some in the industry. It’s fair to say that people are worried.</description>
